{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fff7f0;
      --accent:#ff6f61;
      --muted:#6b6b6b;
      --card:#ffffff;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(17,24,39,0.08);
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg, #fffaf6 0%, var(--bg) 100%);color:#222}
    /* pattern overlay */
    .hero{background-image: url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:repeat;}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 28px;}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffefd8,#ffd9d2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#7a3f3a;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    nav a{margin-left:14px;text-decoration:none;color:#7a3f3a;font-weight:600}
    main{max-width:980px;margin:20px auto;padding:28px}

    .hero{border-radius:14px;padding:30px;margin-bottom:20px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center}
    .hero .left{flex:1}
    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:28px;color:#5a2b27}
    .hero p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
    .cta-row{margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px}
    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
    .btn.secondary{background:transparent;color:var(--accent);border:2px solid rgba(255,111,97,0.12)}

    /* contact form */
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:22px}
    form{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:#5a2b27;margin-top:10px}
    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(10,10,10,0.06);margin-top:6px;font-size:14px}
    textarea{min-height:120px}
    .meta{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fff7f2);padding:16px;border-radius:12px}

    /* proof gallery */
    .proof{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff2ec20,#fff);padding:18px;border-radius:12px}
    .testi{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .avatar{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffe8de,#ffd2c8);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#7a3f3a}
    .quote{font-style:italic;color:#3b2a29}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}
    .badge{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fff8f6);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;cursor:default}
    .badge svg{width:20px;height:20px;opacity:0.9}
    .badge .tip{display:none;position:absolute;background:#222;color:#fff;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px}

    /* pricing comparator */
    .pricing-box{background:var(--card);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .toggle{display:flex;background:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:4px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);width:220px}
    .toggle button{flex:1;padding:8px;border-radius:999px;border:0;background:transparent;cursor:pointer}
    .toggle .active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ffeddc,#ffdcd3);box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.03)}
    .price{font-size:28px;color:#5a2b27;font-weight:800}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    footer{padding:28px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    .faq{margin-top:18px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fffaf6);padding:16px;border-radius:12px}

    /* tiny responsive */
    @media (max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{flex-direction:column}.pricing-box{width:100%}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">A</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:800;color:#5a2b27">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Welcome</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="blends.html">Blends</a>
      <a href="shop.html">Boutique</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Plans</a>
      <a href="about.html">Story</a>
      <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="left">
        <h1>Connect with {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — gentle, clear, and personal</h1>
        <p>Send a note about what you’re curious to explore. Whether you want a single blend from the boutique or a tailored session that may support steady calm, we’ll meet you where you are.</p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class="btn secondary" href="book.html">Reserve a time</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="width:320px">
        <div class="meta">
          <div style="font-weight:700;color:#5a2b27">Quick contact</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">Call or email — we reply within 48 hours</div>
          <div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:14px">
            <div><strong>Phone:</strong> {{PHONE}}</div>
            <div style="margin-top:6px"><strong>Email:</strong> {{EMAIL}}</div>
            <div style="margin-top:6px"><strong>Location:</strong> {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="grid">
      <form id="contactForm" aria-label="Contact form">
        <label for="name">Your name</label>
        <input id="name" name="name" placeholder="Name" required />

        <label for="email">Email</label>
        <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" required />

        <label for="phone">Phone</label>
        <input id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="Optional" />

        <label for="service">I'm interested in</label>
        <select id="service" name="service">
          <option>Intro Session — scent exploration</option>
          <option>Custom blend (retail)</option>
          <option>Follow-up session</option>
          <option>Wholesale / partnership</option>
        </select>

        <label for="message">Message</label>
        <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us a little about what you hope for"></textarea>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center">
          <button class="btn" type="submit">Send message</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn secondary" onclick="document.getElementById('contactForm').reset()">Clear</button>
        </div>
      </form>

      <aside>
        <div class="proof">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
            <div style="font-weight:800;color:#5a2b27">Proof gallery</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Glimpses and badges</div>
          </div>

          <div id="testimonial" class="testi" style="margin-top:14px">
            <div class="avatar" id="tAvatar">J</div>
            <div>
              <div id="tQuote" class="quote">"Gentle, approachable, and very informative. The blend still feels like a small pause in my day."</div>
              <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px" id="tWho">— Jamie, client</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="badges" id="badges">
            <div class="badge" data-tip="Certified aromatherapist, clinical hours logged">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M12 2l2.94 4.93L20 8.3l-4 3.9L17.88 20 12 16.9 6.12 20 8 12.2 4 8.3l5.06-1.37L12 2z" fill="#ff6f61"/></svg>
              <div>Certified</div>
            </div>
            <div class="badge" data-tip="Retail specialist: blends crafted for home use">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2" stroke="#ff6f61" stroke-width="1.2" fill="#fff0ea"/></svg>
              <div>Retail</div>
            </div>
            <div class="badge" data-tip="Community workshops & demonstrations">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4 21l8-5 8 5V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2z" fill="#ffd3ca" stroke="#ff6f61"/></svg>
              <div>Workshops</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Hover badges to read details. Testimonials rotate automatically.</div>
        </div>

        <div style="height:18px"></div>

        <div class="pricing-box">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
            <div style="font-weight:800;color:#5a2b27">Quick pricing view</div>
            <div class="toggle" role="tablist" aria-label="Pricing toggle">
              <button id="tMonthly">Monthly</button>
              <button id="tPackage" class="active">Package</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
            <div>
              <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Intro Session</div>
              <div class="price" id="priceIntro">$120</div>
              <div class="small">1:1 session — may support immediate scent guidance</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align:right">
              <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Signature Blend</div>
              <div class="price" id="priceBlend">$36</div>
              <div class="small">30ml retail — crafted for home use</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:6px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Toggle to compare a monthly support option vs purchasing bundles. Numbers animate so you can watch the change.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq" style="margin-top:12px">
          <div style="font-weight:800;color:#5a2b27">FAQ — safety & notes</div>
          <div style="margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">
            <div><strong>Patch test:</strong> Always do a small patch test. Apply a diluted amount to the inner forearm and wait 24 hours.</div>
            <div style="margin-top:6px"><strong>Dilution guidance:</strong> Blends are crafted for topical use at recommended dilutions; follow the label. For face or sensitive skin, reduce dilution further.</div>
            <div style="margin-top:6px"><strong>Pets:</strong> Some essential oils may be irritating to pets; keep blends and diffusers out of reach and consult your veterinarian for specific concerns.</div>
            <div style="margin-top:6px"><strong>Pregnancy & nursing:</strong> Certain oils are not recommended during pregnancy or breastfeeding. Please disclose pregnancy when booking; we will recommend safe alternatives.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section style="margin-top:18px;background:var(--card);padding:16px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:800;color:#5a2b27">Want an answer faster?</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">Try our quick booking or send a message — we’ll follow up with details and a recommended next step.</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <a class="btn" href="book.html">Reserve a slot</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> • {{PHONE}}</div>
    <div style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)">© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}}. All blends crafted with care. Not medical advice — aromatherapy may support well-being.</div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // small utilities
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Proof Gallery: rotating testimonials
    (function(){
      const testimonials = [
        {who:'Jamie, client','quote':'I kept the roller in my bag for weeks — it reminded me to take a quiet breath each afternoon.' ,avatar:'J'},
        {who:'Rosa, workshop attendee','quote':'The workshop felt playful and structured. I left with a blend I actually use.' ,avatar:'R'},
        {who:'Marta, boutique buyer','quote':'Packaging is thoughtful. The scent card made sampling easy before I bought.' ,avatar:'M'}
      ];
      let idx = 0;
      const elQuote = document.getElementById('tQuote');
      const elWho = document.getElementById('tWho');
      const elAvatar = document.getElementById('tAvatar');
      function show(i){
        const t = testimonials[i];
        // fade animation
        elQuote.style.opacity = 0; elWho.style.opacity = 0; elAvatar.style.opacity = 0;
        setTimeout(()=>{
          elQuote.textContent = '"' + t.quote + '"';
          elWho.textContent = '— ' + t.who;
          elAvatar.textContent = t.avatar;
          elQuote.style.opacity = 1; elWho.style.opacity = 1; elAvatar.style.opacity = 1;
        },260);
      }
      show(0);
      setInterval(()=>{ idx = (idx+1) % testimonials.length; show(idx); },5000);

      // badges: simple tooltip on hover
      const badges = document.querySelectorAll('.badge');
      badges.forEach(b=>{
        const tip = b.getAttribute('data-tip');
        if(!tip) return;
        const span = document.createElement('span');
        span.className = 'tip'; span.textContent = tip; span.style.position='absolute'; span.style.whiteSpace='nowrap'; span.style.transform='translateY(-8px)';
        b.style.position='relative';
        b.appendChild(span);
        b.addEventListener('mouseenter',()=>{ span.style.display='block'; span.style.left='0'; span.style.top='-36px'; });
        b.addEventListener('mouseleave',()=>{ span.style.display='none'; });
      });
    })();

    // Pricing comparator: monthly vs package with animated numbers
    (function(){
      const monthly = {intro:80, blend:12};
      const pack = {intro:120, blend:36};
      let mode = 'package';
      const btnM = document.getElementById('tMonthly');
      const btnP = document.getElementById('tPackage');
      const elIntro = document.getElementById('priceIntro');
      const elBlend = document.getElementById('priceBlend');

      function setActive(){
        btnM.classList.toggle('active', mode==='monthly');
        btnP.classList.toggle('active', mode==='package');
      }

      function animateNumber(el, start, end, duration){
        const startTime = performance.now();
        function step(now){
          const t = Math.min(1,(now-startTime)/duration);
          const val = Math.round(start + (end-start) * t);
          el.textContent = '$' + val;
          if(t < 1) requestAnimationFrame(step);
        }
        requestAnimationFrame(step);
      }

      function update(){
        const target = mode==='monthly' ? monthly : pack;
        // parse current numbers
        const curIntro = parseInt(elIntro.textContent.replace('$',''))||0;
        const curBlend = parseInt(elBlend.textContent.replace('$',''))||0;
        animateNumber(elIntro, curIntro, target.intro, 520);
        animateNumber(elBlend, curBlend, target.blend, 520);
      }

      btnM.addEventListener('click',()=>{ mode='monthly'; setActive(); update(); });
      btnP.addEventListener('click',()=>{ mode='package'; setActive(); update(); });

      setActive();
      // initial values presumed package
      elIntro.textContent = '$' + pack.intro;
      elBlend.textContent = '$' + pack.blend;
    })();

    // faux form handler (demonstration only)
    document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const name = this.name.value || 'Friend';
      alert('Thanks, ' + name + '. We received your message and will reply at ' + (this.email.value || 'your email') + '.');
      this.reset();
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Contact page chunk — aromatherapy template

This bundle includes two files for the contact page chunk of the aromatherapy site.

Files:
- contact.html — full contact page with inline styles and JavaScript.
- README.md — this file.

Features implemented in contact.html:
- Hero with quick contact details and CTAs. Uses placeholders: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}.
- Contact form (client-side demo only) that alerts on submit and resets the form.
- Proof Gallery: rotating testimonials (auto-rotates every 5s) and credibility badges with tooltips on hover. Implemented in local JS.
- Pricing Comparator: toggle between "Monthly" and "Package" pricing with animated number transitions. Implemented in local JS.
- FAQ safety notes: patch testing, dilution guidance, pets, pregnancy/nursing — language is safety-forward and avoids medical claims.
- Responsive layout with a playful, warm visual style via CSS only (no external assets).

Developer notes:
- The page references an SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg for background patterning. If you are assembling the full site, include a unique SVG at that path so the hero will render the pattern correctly.
- The contact form is a demo and does not submit to a server. Replace the form handler with your backend integration or service of choice.
- All CTA links use placeholders; be sure to replace them with the concrete URLs and business values.

Accessibility & behavior:
- Toggle uses buttons and updates ARIA via role attribute on the wrapper; numeric animations are visual only.
- Tooltip text is injected to each badge from the data-tip attribute.

Copyright: template chunk for an aromatherapy practitioner site.
"} 
BUNDLE_END
